flowchart TD
    ListStart([CLI 已解析/校验 List 参数]) --> Inspect[无锁 Inspect journal]
    Inspect -->|无 journal| Debug[可选 Debug]
    Inspect -->|合法活动 journal| Warn[Warn 并提示 apm fix]
    Inspect -->|损坏或不可读| Damaged[Warn journal 已损坏]
    Debug --> ListInstalled{指定 --installed?}
    Warn --> ListInstalled
    Damaged --> ListInstalled

    ListInstalled -->|否：Cloud| CloudList[Cloud List]
    CloudList -->|失败| Fatal[返回 fatal error：不渲染业务输出]
    CloudList -->|成功| CloudCompute[按可选 type 过滤；Type/Name/Version 排序]
    CloudCompute --> CloudRender[CLI 渲染 `<type>/<name>@<version>`] --> CloudExit([退出])

    ListInstalled -->|是| Refresh[RefreshInstalled：复制注册 Agent、按字典序 Detect]
    Refresh -->|失败| Fatal
    Refresh -->|成功| Select{具体 Agent 或 all?}
    Select -->|具体 Agent 不在快照| Fatal
    Select -->|具体 Agent| ReadOne[Config.List]
    ReadOne -->|失败| Fatal
    ReadOne -->|成功| InstalledCompute[按可选 type 过滤并排序]
    Select -->|all| ReadAll[按快照字典序读取全部 Config]
    ReadAll --> PartialStore[保留逐 Agent失败并继续]
    PartialStore --> InstalledCompute
    InstalledCompute --> HasPartial{存在 all 的读取失败?}
    HasPartial -->|否| InstalledRender[CLI 渲染 `<agent>/<type>/<name>@<version>`] --> InstalledExit([成功退出])
    HasPartial -->|是| PartialRender[先渲染成功记录] --> PartialError[CLI 记录一次 partial error、usage、非零退出]
